[00:20.61]I've been stuck in the middle pages
{"我困在故事的中间篇章"}
[00:22.89]Hung up on a cross that I created
{"悬挂在自己筑起的十字架上"}
[00:25.95]Built out of the bones that I've been breaking
{"用我不断粉碎的骸骨搭建"}
[00:31.16]The sign you said you needed
{"你说你需要一个征兆"}
[00:33.44]Is there but you can't see it
{"它就在那 你却看不见"}
[00:35.98]You might be down and out but you're still breathing
{"或许你落魄潦倒 但仍在呼吸"}
[00:42.53]If you write the story
{"若由你执笔书写故事"}
[00:44.91]You'll find out we're all stuck on the same page
{"会发现我们都卡在同一页"}
[00:51.69]Cause' sometimes things will bend you
{"因为有时命运会压弯你"}
[00:54.34]But trust me you'll be fine
{"但请相信终会好起来"}
[00:56.88]cause I've been moving mountains that I once had to climb
{"我曾翻越那些必须攀登的山脉"}
[01:01.89]And life's not out to get you
{"生活并非刻意针对你"}
[01:04.49]Despite the things you've been through
{"尽管你历经沧桑"}
[01:06.98]Because what you give is what you get
{"因为你付出什么就会得到什么"}
[01:09.88]And it doesn't make sense to make do
{"将就度日本就毫无意义"}
[01:25.98]The walls are caving in again
{"墙壁又开始向内坍塌"}
[01:26.88]Happens every now and then
{"这种情况时常发生"}
[01:28.15]Always got me feeling like I'm ******
{"总让我感觉自己糟透了"}
[01:30.86]Falling in and out of bed
{"在床上反复挣扎起身"}
[01:32.14]Sleep so I feel like I'm dead
{"沉睡让我感觉像具尸体"}
[01:33.40]Trying to get a grip is kinda rough
{"试图振作却举步维艰"}
[01:35.89]You say life has lost its meaning
