[01:38.03]And that's true if you believe it
{"若你深信不疑便会成真"}
[01:40.67]But someday you will stand above your demons
{"但终有一天你会凌驾心魔之上"}
[01:44.34]You're not beneath this
{"你并非它们的奴仆"}
[01:47.31]If you write the story
